Fork provenance
---------------
This repository is a hard fork of Memoh (https://github.com/felinics/Memoh),
AGPL-3.0, baseline snapshot 2026-11-06 (v0.13 series). Upstream copyright and
license notices are retained. Modifications made by Littly:

- single-person mode (default entry redirects to /littly/, bot creation guarded)
- internal/littly: one-person persona, personality-driven reply policy,
  autobiographical memory vault, people tiers + recycle bin, heartbeat
  ("心声回响" v2), workbench file/artifact tools, SnowLuma OneBot v11 client,
  six-surface embedded UI, settings rework
- nginx entry changes and compose healthcheck/env additions

Design references (no code copied):
- Generative Agents (arXiv:2304.03442)
- Letta sleep-time compute
- Hermes HeartBeat 2.0 (https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/marketplace/heartbeat2)
- Littly v1 "心声回响" (heartbeat.ts)
